# Canin

**A dental clinic management system.**

Canin is a full-featured practice-management application for a specialist dental
clinic in Herat, Afghanistan. It covers the whole clinical and administrative
workflow: patient registration, per-tooth clinical records, lab orders,
prescriptions, financials, and multi-user access control.

> A [Cyborg Tech Creative Agency](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co) project.

---

## What it does

- **Patients** — registration and full patient histories
- **Clinical records** — per-tooth charting and treatment records
- **Lab orders** — track work sent to and returned from the lab
- **Prescriptions** — issue and record prescriptions
- **Financials** — billing and payment tracking
- **Access control** — multi-user accounts with role-based permissions
- **Multilingual** — Farsi, Pashto, and English, with RTL support
- **PWA** — installable, with offline support via a service worker

## Tech stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | PHP 7.4+, CodeIgniter 3 (MVC) |
| Database | MariaDB / MySQL |
| Frontend | Bootstrap 5, AJAX, DataTables, Select2, Toastr.js |
| Dates | Jalali / Shamsi calendar throughout |
| i18n | Farsi (fa), Pashto (pa), English (en); cookie-based, RTL for fa/pa |
| App | PWA (`manifest.json` + service worker) |

